<title>USA: Etec chief financial officer resigns.</title>
<headline>Etec chief financial officer resigns.</headline>
<dateline>HAYWARD, Calif. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Etec Systems Inc said Tuesday its Chief Financial Officer Phil Koen will leave the company in June to join PointCast Inc.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement Steve Cooper, Etec's chairman, president and chief executive will assume Koen's duties while a replacement is being sought.</p>
